SUMMARY:How Deep Is Your Love @ WTW Newquay
DESCRIPTION:How Deep Is Your Love (1h 33min)\nRomance\, Drama\n\nChef Xia M
 ingjun of a fashionable restaurant and his wife Lin Mo have been married f
 or seven years. The previous passion and romance has grown dull and dry. L
 in Mo uses every trick she can think of to restore their marriage\, but Xi
 a Mingjun ends up leaving the city without a word. A year later\, the rebo
 rn Xia Mingjun worked as a diving instructor on an unknown island. He meet
 s a woman named Bai Jie\, and falls in love immediately. Suddenly Mingjun 
 realizes\, all the methods Bai Jie used to approach him were the tricks he
  used to pursue Lin Mo\; could this familiar yet strange woman Bai Jie be 
 his wife?\n\nStarring: Duan Yihong\, Wan Qian\, Qi Xi\, Yuan Hong\, Wu Yue
 \, Dai Xu\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Newquay\nBook tickets: https://wt
 wcinemas.co.uk/newquay/film/5701/how-deep-is-your-love\n\nFilm details: ht
